# Root-level ignore for `vercel deploy` run from the monorepo root.
# Per-app Vercel projects (zer, agent-gateway, website, …) have their own
# rootDirectory inside apps/* — their sources MUST be uploaded, so sibling
# app dirs are NOT excluded here. Only generated/heavy dirs are ignored
# (they are also gitignored; kept here for tgz-archive deploys).

# --- Heavy / generated (also gitignored, kept here for the tgz archive path) ---
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.turbo
**/logs
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
apps/archive/
